    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "can u expand on that though? specifically the part about which concerns are 'politically motivated'. like, if someone is arguing that the bill effectively disenfranchises certain communities, is that a legitimate legal/sociological concern or is that just political rhetoric used to smear the bill?",
